{
  "_comment": [
    "Regression owner of every spec, shared by wdio.conf.ts and .github/workflows/wdio-regression.yml.",
    "Pool groups (primary, secondary, rog, laz, mum, pop) set MB_AUTH_SLOT and must match the smoke owner for smoke specs.",
    "Other groups log in with their own credentials (BH_*, AUTH_SECURITY_*, PD_*) or do not log in, so they take no slot.",
    "Each lane runs its groups interleaved evenly, so consecutive logins of one account are separated by other accounts.",
    "authSecurity lists the specs that lock that account last."
  ],
